  "steps": [
   "Heat the oil in a large saucepan over a medium heat. Cook the onion for 8 minutes, stirring now and then, until soft and golden.",
   "Stir in the garlic, chilli, curry powder and turmeric and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
   "Add the split peas and stock and bring to the boil. Cover and simmer for 30 minutes, stirring now and then. Peel and dice the marrow meanwhile.",
   "Stir in the marrow and simmer uncovered for 15 to 20 minutes, until the peas have broken down and the marrow is tender.",
   "Add the broccoli and cook for 5 minutes, until just tender. Loosen with a splash of water if needed.",
